<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - SPX Corp started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - SPX Corp started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns initiated coverage of SPX Corp with a buy rating, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- SPX Corp gained 1/2 to 69-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not available.</p>
</text>
